#: rustconn/src/app.rs:1739
msgid ""
"Modern connection manager for Linux with a GTK4/Wayland-native interface. "
"Manage SSH, RDP, VNC, SPICE, Telnet, Serial, Kubernetes, and Zero Trust "
"connections from a single application."
msgstr ""
"Сучасны менеджар злучэнняў для Linux з інтэрфейсам GTK4/Wayland. Кіруйце "
"злучэннямі SSH, RDP, VNC, SPICE, Telnet, Serial, Kubernetes і Zero Trust з "
"адной праграмы."

